,"lemma":"வல்","gloss":"fast"}],"gloss":"fast"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என்","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வேந்துவிடு","parts":[{"text":"வேந்து","lemma":"வேந்தன்","gloss":"king"},{"text":"விடு","lemma":"விடு","gloss":"send"}],"gloss":"sent by the king"},{"surface":"விழுத்தூது","parts":[{"text":"விழு","lemma":"விழு","gloss":"excellent"},{"text":"தூது","lemma":"தூது","gloss":"messengers"}],"gloss":"excellent messengers"},{"surface":"ஆங்காங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"there"},{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"there"}],"gloss":"here and there"},{"surface":"இசைப்ப","parts":[{"text":"இசைப்ப","lemma":"இசை","gloss":"to announce"}],"gloss":"as they announce"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நூலரி","parts":[{"text":"நூல்","lemma":"நூல்","gloss":"thread"},{"text":"அரி","lemma":"அரி","gloss":"fine"}],"gloss":"strung on a fine thread"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"garland"}],"gloss":"garland"},{"surface":"சூடி","parts":[{"text":"சூடி","lemma":"சூடு","gloss":"having worn"}],"gloss":"having worn"},{"surface":"காலின்","parts":[{"text":"காலின்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"by foot"}],"gloss":"on foot"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தமியன்","parts":[{"text":"தமியன்","lemma":"தமியன்","gloss":"lone man"}],"gloss":"alone"},{"surface":"வந்த","parts":[{"text":"வந்த","lemma":"வா","gloss":"who came"}],"gloss":"who came"},{"surface":"மூதிலாளன்","parts":[{"text":"மூதில்","lemma":"மூதில்","gloss":"ancient house"},{"text":"ஆளன்","lemma":"ஆளன்","gloss":"man"}],"gloss":"man of an ancient warrior family"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அருஞ்சமம்","parts":[{"text":"அருஞ்சமம்","lemma":"அருஞ்சமம்","gloss":"difficult battle"}],"gloss":"difficult battle","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தாங்கி","parts":[{"text":"தாங்கி","lemma":"தாங்கு","gloss":"having withstood"}],"gloss":"withstanding"},{"surface":"முன்னின்று","parts":[{"text":"முன்","lemma":"முன்","gloss":"in front"},{"text":"நின்று","lemma":"நில்","gloss":"having stood"}],"gloss":"standing in front"},{"surface":"எறிந்த","parts":[{"text":"எறிந்த","lemma":"எறி","gloss":"having struck"}],"gloss":"having struck"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒருகை","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"},{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"hand/trunk"}],"gloss":"one-handed (trunked)"},{"surface":"இரும்பிணத்து","parts":[{"text":"இரும்","lemma":"இரும்","gloss":"huge"},{"text":"பிணத்து","lemma":"பிணம்","gloss":"corpse"}],"gloss":"of the huge elephant corpse"},{"surface":"எயிறு","parts":[{"text":"எயிறு","lemma":"எயிறு","gloss":"tusk"}],"gloss":"tusk"},{"surface":"மிறையாக","parts":[{"text":"மிறை","lemma":"மிறை","gloss":"wedge"},{"text":"ஆக","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"as a wedge"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திரிந்த","parts":[{"text":"திரிந்த","lemma":"திரி","gloss":"bent"}],"gloss":"bent"},{"surface":"வாய்வாள்","parts":[{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"edge"},{"text":"வாள்","lemma":"வாள்","gloss":"sword"}],"gloss":"sharp-edged sword"},{"surface":"திருத்தா","parts":[{"text":"திருத்தா","lemma":"திருத்து","gloss":"straightening"}],"gloss":"straightening"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தனக்கு","parts":[{"text":"தனக்கு","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"to himself"}],"gloss":"from himself"},{"surface":"இரிந்தானை","parts":[{"text":"இரிந்தான்","lemma":"இரி","gloss":"one who fled"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative suffix"}],"gloss":"the one who fled"},{"surface":"பெயர்புறம்","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்","lemma":"பெயர்","gloss":"retreating"},{"text":"புறம்","lemma":"புறம்","gloss":"back"}],"gloss":"retreating back"},{"surface":"நகுமே","parts":[{"text":"நகுமே","lemma":"நகு","gloss":"laughs"}],"gloss":"laughs indeed"}]}],"literal":"May he come indeed quickly, may he come indeed fast, saying / as the excellent messengers sent by the king announce here and there, / wearing a garland strung on a fine thread, on foot, / the warrior of the ancient house who came alone, / withstanding the difficult battle, standing in front and striking, / using the tusk of the huge, dead, one-handed elephant as a wedge, / straightening his bent sharp-edged sword, / laughs at the retreating back of the one who fled from him.","translation":"As the king's great messengers announce here and there, 'May he come quickly! May he come fast!', the warrior from an ancient noble family arrives on foot, alone, wearing a garland strung on a fine thread. Withstanding the fierce battle, he stands at the forefront and strikes down a massive elephant. Then, using the tusk of the fallen beast as a wedge, he straightens his sharp sword that had bent from the blow, and laughs at the retreating back of the enemy who fled from him in terror.","modern":"அரசன் அனுப்பிய சிறந்த தூதுவர்கள், 'விரைவாக வரட்டும், வேகமாக வரட்டும்!' என்று ஆங்காங்கே முரசு கொட்டி அறிவிக்க, மெல்லிய நூலில் தொடுக்கப்பட்ட மாலையை அணிந்து, தனியாகக் கால்நடையாக வந்தான் அந்தப் பழமையான வீரக் குடும்பத்தைச் சேர்ந்த வீரன். அவன் கடுமையான போரைத் தாங்கி, முன்னணியில் நின்று தாக்கியபோது, ஒரு துதிக்கையையுடைய பெரிய யானையைக் கொன்றான். அந்த யானையின் உடலிலிருந்து வெளிப்பட்ட தந்தத்தை ஒரு முட்டுக் கட்டையாகக் கொண்டு, போரின் தாக்கத்தால் வளைந்துபோன தன் கூர்மையான வாளை நிமிர்த்தினான். அவ்வாறு நிமிர்த்திக்கொண்டே, தனக்கு அஞ்சி ஓடிய பகைவனின் முதுகுப் புறத்தைப் பார்த்து அவன் எள்ளி நகையாடுகிறான்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Tumpai tiṇai, which celebrates the valor of warriors engaged in battle. The poet describes a brave warrior from an ancient, noble family of fighters. When the king's messengers summon warriors to the battlefield, crying 'Come quickly, come fast!', this warrior arrives on foot, alone, wearing a simple garland. In the fierce battle, he stands at the forefront and slays a massive elephant. When his sharp sword bends from the heavy blow, he calmly uses the tusk of the fallen elephant as a wedge to straighten his weapon. Seeing this terrifying display of courage, his opponent flees in fear, and the warrior laughs at the retreating back of his enemy.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[1.9,2.2],[2.8,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,4.5],[4.5,5.13],[5.13,5.6],[5.6,5.9],[5.9,6.2],[6.2,6.76],[6.76,7.5],[7.5,7.86],[7.86,8.11],[8.11,8.47],[8.47,9.2],[9.2,9.7],[9.7,10.1],[10.27,10.6],[10.6,11.4],[11.4,12.13],[12.13,12.47],[12.47,13.0],[13.13,13.8],[13.8,13.93],[14.07,14.2],[14.2,15.8],[15.8,16.25],[16.25,16.7],[16.7,17.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.7,2.0],[2.0,2.4],[3.11,3.82],[3.82,4.3],[4.3,4.8],[4.8,5.54],[5.54,6.1],[6.1,6.4],[6.4,6.7],[6.7,7.13],[7.13,7.71],[7.71,8.15],[8.15,8.44],[8.44,8.87],[8.87,9.74],[9.74,10.18],[10.18,10.9],[10.9,11.6],[11.6,12.6],[12.6,13.2],[13.47,13.6],[13.6,14.2],[14.2,15.0],[15.0,15.6],[15.6,16.23],[16.3,17.17],[17.17,17.49],[17.6,18.2],[18.2,18.5]]},"sync":[[["வருகதில்","may he come indeed"]],[["வல்லே","quickly"]],[["வருகதில்","may he come indeed"]],[["வல்","fast"]],[["என","saying"]],[["வேந்துவிடு","sent by the king"]],[["விழுத்தூது","excellent messengers"]],[["ஆங்காங்கு","here and there"]],[["இசைப்ப","as they announce"]],[["நூலரி","strung on a fine thread"]],[["மாலை","garland"]],[["சூடி","having worn"],["காலின்","on foot"]],[["காலின்","on foot"]],[["தமியன்","alone"]],[["வந்த","who came"]],[["மூதிலாளன்","man of an ancient warrior family"]],[["மூதிலாளன்","man of an ancient warrior family"]],[["அருஞ்சமம்","difficult battle"]],[["தாங்கி","withstanding"]],[["முன்னின்று","standing in front"]],[["எறிந்த","having struck"]],[["ஒருகை","one-handed (trunked)"]],[["இரும்பிணத்து","of the huge elephant corpse"]],[["எயிறு","tusk"]],[["மிறையாக","as a wedge"]],[["திரிந்த","bent"]],[["வாய்வாள்","sharp-edged sword"]],[["திருத்தா","straightening"]],[["தனக்கு","from himself"],["இரிந்தானை","the one who fled"]],[["இரிந்தானை","the one who fled"],["பெயர்புறம்","retreating back"]],[["பெயர்புறம்","retreating back"]],[["நகுமே","laughs indeed"]]]}